ould only be from Cirque du Soleil! ANTS, the foot-juggling act from \\\"OVO\\\" will be here to wow the crowd!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":107,\"name\":\"Seth Rogen, Bethenny Frankel\",\"overview\":\"SETH ROGEN has gone from Hollywood's everyman to Hollywood's leading man! He's not only starred in, but has written and produced some of the biggest comedies of the past few years. He's sitting down with Ellen to tell her about his independent spirit, and how he'll be hosting the 27th Annual Film Independent Spirit Awards on Saturday!\\n\\n \\n\\nThen, she's the Real Housewife that's taken on the world! BETHENNY FRANKEL can write a book, host a talk show, and make a healthy snack -- all while sipping one of her famous Skinny Girl margaritas! This Jill of all trades is sitting down with Ellen to discuss her hit show, \\\"Bethenny Ever After.\\\" She'll also be demonstrating one of her world-famous homemaking tips!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":108,\"name\":\"Meredith Viera, Emily vanCamp\",\"overview\":\"Whether she's anchoring the news, moderating \\\"The View\\\" or hosting \\\"Who Wants to Be a Millionaire?\\\" the fabulous and funny MEREDITH VIEIRA is always up for a good time. Now she's a Special Correspondent for \\\"Rock Center with Brian Williams.\\\" Where will she wind up next? She's here to tell Ellen all about it.\\n\\n \\n\\nThen, EMILY VanCAMP is the star of Ellen's favorite new show on television! \\\"Revenge\\\" has had us on the edge of our seats for the entire first season, and Ellen is desperate for a chance to get some inside information. She's grilling her lovely guest for all of the details on Monday!\\n\\n \\n\\nPlus, we're going behind the scenes of Ellen's hilarious new JCPenney commercials, and you've got a front-row seat! And Ellen will once more change the life of an inspiring viewer in need of a boos