y, as only she can -- at the Guinness Museum. Don't miss this taped piece that is sure to make international headlines!\\n\\nPlus, AMANDA PEET has starred in countless films and TV shows, from \\\"Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip\\\" to the action film, \\\"2012.\\\" She's here to talk about her life, her two adorable kids, and her new NBC comedy, \\\"Bent.\\\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-16\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":123,\"name\":\"Jennifer Aniston, The Skating Aratas\",\"overview\":\"She's one of the biggest names in Hollywood, one of the most identifiable stars in the world, and one of Ellen's closest friends -- it's JENNIFER ANISTON! She's starring in the film, \\\"Wanderlust,\\\" which had Ellen in stitches! It's also the film where she met her very cute and very funny new boyfriend, Justin Theroux. Ellen will be talking to her good friend about her new love, her new film and everything in between!\\n\\nPlus, an incredible skating act that will have you at the edge of your seat! Don't miss THE SKATING ARATAS this Monday\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-26\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":124,\"name\":\"Ed Helms, Kathy Freston\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-13\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":125,\"name\":\"Sophie Grace and Rosie, Channing Tatum\",\"overview\":\"It's the return of the most entertaining girls from the UK! SOPHIA GRACE and ROSIE, those two precocious prima donnas from Essex are back and ready to take on the world. They've blown the roof off our studio with spectacular performances, hosted the red carpet at the AMAs, and you won't believe what Ellen has in store for them next!\\n\\nAnd the incredibly handsome CHANNING TATUM is swinging by to tell Ellen about his heartbreaking film, \\\"The Vow.\\\" Channing always gets into trouble when he's here, whether he's revealing racy photos or giving Ellen a lap dance! Today he just mi